Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.76,0:00:02.10,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Autumn is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:05.17,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,The cultural festival is over, and now
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.17,0:00:07.48,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,we're preparing for the athletic festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.48,0:00:14.86,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fs20\shad0\bord0\fnArial\c&HA3BBAB&\move(544,63,710,63)}October 17th\N (Mon.)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.48,0:00:14.86,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fs20\shad0\bord0\fnArial\c&HA3BBAB&\move(424,83,590,83)}Athletic \NFestival\N Teams
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.48,0:00:14.86,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fs20\shad0\bord0\fnArial\c&HA3BBAB&\u1\move(280,82,440,82)}Relay{\u0}\NInuzuka\NShikimori
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.48,0:00:14.86,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fs20\shad0\bord0\fnArial\c&HA3BBAB&\u1\move(73,99,233,99)}Scavenger Hunt Race{\u0}\NNagumo \NTaneda \NHenna
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.48,0:00:14.86,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fs20\shad0\bord0\fnArial\c&HA3BBAB&\u1\move(-91,73,69,73)}Boys & Girls\N Mixed Relay
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.01,0:00:11.09,Main,Student1 E10,0,0,0,,Okay, that takes care of \Nthe scavenger hunt race.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.09,0:00:14.86,Main,Student1 E10,0,0,0,,Next up is... the boys and girls mixed relay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:17.34,Main,Student1 E10,0,0,0,,And since nobody's volunteered...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.34,0:00:18.87,Main,Student1 E10,0,0,0,,We'll pick the runners by lottery.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.46,0:00:20.88,Main,Student1 E10,0,0,0,,Okay, line up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.61,0:00:24.36,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I won't be of any help,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.36,0:00:27.17,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,so I hope I get an event \Nthat's not a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.17,0:00:29.99,Main,Student2 E10,0,0,0,,With a lottery, you know \Nit's gonna end up being Izumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.99,0:00:31.97,Main,Student3 E10,0,0,0,,Poor Izumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.97,0:00:33.50,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I haven't even drawn yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.51,0:00:34.88,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\frz22\shad0\bord0\pos(297,81)\c&H32384B&\b1}Boys & Girls Mixed Relay
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.51,0:00:34.88,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\frz25\fs20\shad0\bord0\c&H4A3FD3&\b1\pos(506,158)}You're In
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.15,0:00:38.24,Main,Student2 E10,0,0,0,,It doesn't even surprise me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.24,0:00:40.07,Main,Student3 E10,0,0,0,,All is as it should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.39,0:00:43.15,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I saw this coming myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.07,0:00:51.72,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Not the relay... Not the relay...\N Not the relay...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.72,0:00:53.41,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,She really doesn't want this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.05,0:00:53.41,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Not the relay...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.98,0:00:57.25,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Please, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.24,0:00:58.66,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\frz-15\fs16\shad0\bord0\c&H32384B&\b1\pos(452,98)}Boys & Girls Mixed Relay
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.24,0:00:58.66,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\frz-10\fs16\shad0\bord0\c&H4A3FD3&\b1\pos(507,231)}You're In
