Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.91,0:01:07.42,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fs12\shad0\bord0\fnArial\c&HA3BBAB&\u1)\pos(467,56)}Relay{\u0}\NInuzuka\NShikimori
