Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.91,0:01:07.42,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fs12\shad0\bord0\fnArial\c&HA3BBAB&\u1\pos(213,57)}Boys & Girls Mixed Relay {\u0}\NIzumi \NHachimitsu
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.41,0:01:03.80,Main,Student1 E10,0,0,0,,So our first girl for the \Nrelay is Hachimitsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.80,0:01:06.20,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Let's just try our best, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.74,0:01:10.05,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Hachimitsu-san... Please get up...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.41,0:01:10.75,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Wanna trade?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.42,0:01:12.42,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(900,1)\pos(333,253)\fnArial\fs16\c&H94979E&\3c&HF2F6F7&\4c&HF2F6F7&}You're Out
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.46,0:01:11.63,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hachimitsu-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.52,0:01:12.41,Main,Student12 E10,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:14.41,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.47,0:01:16.68,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(430,1)\fnArial\b1\frz15\c&H5B31D7&\3c&HF2F1F8&\4c&H5B31D7&\pos(450,69)}Tha-Thump
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.67,0:01:19.35,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san! I'm in the relay, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.35,0:01:20.92,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Wow, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.51,0:01:23.67,Italics,All,0,0,0,,She's so overprotective...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.28,0:01:26.65,Main,Student1 E10,0,0,0,,We just need one more \Nboy and one more girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.65,0:01:27.45,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.78,0:01:28.95,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,I'll do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.70,0:01:31.58,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,How come, Inuzuka-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.85,0:01:35.19,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,'Cause a relay with you \Nguys oughta be super fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.83,0:01:37.70,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Okay, then I'll do it, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.13,0:01:40.81,Main,Student1 E10,0,0,0,,You guys really are good friends, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.81,0:01:43.20,Main,Student1 E10,0,0,0,,Okay, that's it for the mixed relay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.47,0:01:47.08,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,This should be a fun relay, huh, Izumi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.05,0:01:52.23,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I feel so much better, \NInuzuka-kun! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.23,0:01:54.21,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Sure! Let's show 'em what we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.18,0:01:59.67,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,If you're gonna play the hero, \Ndo it where he can see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.67,0:02:02.23,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I wasn't trying to play the hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.22,0:02:04.22,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fs20\shad0\bord0\fnArial\c&HCCDDCD&\u1\pos(306,142)\b1}Boys & Girls Mixed Relay {\u0}\NIzumi \NHachimitsu\NShikimori \NInuzuka \NNekozaki
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.84,0:02:06.66,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,What's our running order?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.06,0:02:10.10,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,There's something I'd like to say first.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.10,0:02:11.27,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.27,0:02:13.52,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I'm going to hold you all back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.52,0:02:15.00,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,You're just announcing that now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.03,0:02:27.37,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(2440,1)\pos(144,92)\b1\fnComic Sans MS\c&HEF9E5A&\3c&H73331F&\4c&H73331F&}Indoorsy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.44,0:02:18.82,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sorry... I'll do my best, \Nbut I'll probably hold you back too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.09,0:02:23.19,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,At least Izumi's here. \NThat makes me feel a little better.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.19,0:02:26.95,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Nah, he's not slow or anything. \NHe just falls a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.71,0:02:30.25,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,You traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.25,0:02:32.97,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,D-Don't worry! It's a sure bet I'll fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.97,0:02:34.38,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,What kind of follow-up is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.82,0:02:37.97,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,I don't think you need to worry so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.97,0:02:38.89,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.51,0:02:40.42,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,We're—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.42,0:02:42.26,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,We're here, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.26,0:02:44.45,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What is with you?! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.45,0:02:46.63,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Why are you mad at me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.10,0:02:48.53,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.53,0:02:50.40,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,With the five of us on the team,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.16,0:02:53.73,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,I bet it's gonna make for a great memory!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.81,0:03:00.17,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I think this will be the most fun \Nathletic festival of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.91,0:03:03.80,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,How is Izumi so optimistic?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.37,0:03:08.79,Main,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(1780,1)\an8\fs30\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\c&H907F7D&\3c&HEEEDEB&}Shikimori's {\c&H696767&}Not {\c&H989595&}Just {\c&H92767E&}a {\c&H928B8B&}Cutie
