Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.02,0:04:43.12,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Time to practice for the\N boys and girls mixed relay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.12,0:04:47.63,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,One practice isn't gonna make \Nslow runners any faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.63,0:04:50.26,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Well, let's just do everything we can!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.70,0:04:53.55,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,I mean, the five of us actually \Nget to do this together!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.55,0:04:54.72,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,We wanna win!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.06,0:04:56.80,Main,Izu/Inu/Shiki,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.80,0:05:00.11,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Okay, let's spread out a bit \Nand practice the hand-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.45,0:05:01.42,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.45,0:05:01.42,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.45,0:05:01.42,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,{\an8}Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.90,0:05:05.86,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,1)\fnArial\fs16\b1\shad0\c&HFFF9FC&\blur2\3c&H404142&\pos(179.333,193.333)}First Leg \N{\fs24}Nekozaki
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.90,0:05:07.87,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,1)\fnArial\fs16\b1\an8\shad0\c&HFFF9FC&\blur2\3c&H404142&\pos(483.333,152.333)}Second Leg \N{\fs24}Hachimitsu
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.91,0:05:09.87,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,1)\fnArial\fs16\b1\shad0\c&HFFF9FC&\blur2\3c&H404142&\pos(156.333,209.333)}Third Leg \N{\fs24}Izumi
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.91,0:05:11.87,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,1)\fnArial\fs16\b1\shad0\c&HFFF9FC&\blur2\3c&H404142&\pos(493.333,210.333)}Fourth Leg \N{\fs24}Shikimori
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.91,0:05:13.87,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,1)\fnArial\fs16\b1\shad0\c&HFFF9FC&\an8\blur2\3c&H404142&\pos(137.333,172.333)}Anchor \N{\fs24}Inuzuka
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.19,0:05:16.19,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.21,0:05:18.08,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.63,0:05:19.02,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnComic Sans MS\fs14\shad0\bord0\c&H616384&\b1\frz10\pos(337,39)}Trot
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.15,0:05:19.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnComic Sans MS\fs14\shad0\bord0\c&H616384&\b1\frz10\pos(223,111)}Trot
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.65,0:05:20.02,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnComic Sans MS\fs14\shad0\bord0\c&H616384&\b1\frz10\pos(294,33)}Trot
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.15,0:05:20.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnComic Sans MS\fs14\shad0\bord0\c&H616384&\b1\frz10\pos(174,104)}Trot
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.65,0:05:21.02,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnComic Sans MS\fs14\shad0\bord0\c&H616384&\b1\frz10\pos(270,27)}Trot
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.70,0:05:22.99,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Her stride is way too short!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.15,0:05:21.52,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnComic Sans MS\fs14\shad0\bord0\c&H616384&\b1\frz10\pos(163,92)}Trot
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.65,0:05:22.02,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnComic Sans MS\fs14\shad0\bord0\c&H616384&\b1\frz10\pos(234,19)}Trot
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.13,0:05:24.63,Main,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnComic Sans MS\fs14\shad0\bord0\c&H616384&\b1\frz10\move(160,7,81,-6)}Toddle
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.99,0:05:24.62,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.00,0:05:28.77,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,She's already worn out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.79,0:05:30.75,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,All yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.07,0:05:31.76,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.11,0:05:32.88,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,...the heck?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.88,0:05:34.42,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Izumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.42,0:05:36.09,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,This is hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.48,0:05:40.35,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,It's never gonna work...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.87,0:05:48.75,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.24,0:05:54.49,Main,Izu/Hachi,0,0,0,,W-We're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.86,0:05:58.21,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,As long as we nail the hand-offs, \Nwe should be able to recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.21,0:06:00.64,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It looks like this order should work, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.64,0:06:03.64,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,If you guys get passed, \NShikimori and I can make up ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.43,0:06:06.39,Italics,Izu/Hachi,0,0,0,,They're so nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.62,0:06:09.68,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Okay! One more practice run!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.00,0:06:19.72,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Sorry. We gotta go practice \Nfor our other events.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.72,0:06:22.62,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,I guess that's it for us today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.62,0:06:23.64,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.30,0:06:25.70,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.62,0:06:30.88,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Hachimitsu-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.88,0:06:32.22,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.22,0:06:34.16,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,If you want, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.95,0:06:37.41,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,We could practice a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.32,0:06:41.88,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Yeah. We should.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.60,0:06:50.43,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.46,0:06:54.82,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,We're... doing a lot better \Nthan that first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.82,0:06:55.93,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.25,0:07:00.06,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Let's take a little break.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.06,0:07:01.44,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.93,0:07:07.41,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Hachimitsu-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.41,0:07:08.38,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.38,0:07:09.14,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Eep!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.10,0:07:13.85,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,I just... wanted to thank you \Nfor practicing with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.85,0:07:15.46,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,You're not overdoing it, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.46,0:07:18.55,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I'm at my limit...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.09,0:07:19.94,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.67,0:07:21.95,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.35,0:07:24.97,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I didn't stay to practice for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.28,0:07:26.80,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I'm doing it for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.37,0:07:31.21,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,But it didn't seem like \Nyou wanted to practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.73,0:07:33.22,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.70,0:07:35.52,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I'm always this lethargic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.95,0:07:42.09,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I hate running because it's not \Nlike you get anything out of doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.23,0:07:45.10,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,But this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.59,0:07:47.89,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,It's making you guys happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.89,0:07:51.37,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,So even if it wears me out, \Nit's still good for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.70,0:07:53.99,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Hachimitsu-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.84,0:07:56.87,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,You have so much energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.87,0:07:57.52,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.92,0:07:59.60,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I envy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.27,0:08:03.22,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Put your jacket on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.64,0:08:04.43,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.04,0:08:09.05,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\frz-14\pos(349,242)\shad0\bord0\c&HA1D8F6&}Athletic Festival
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.05,0:08:12.55,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\blur2\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\c&H241C41&\b1\move(339,201,91,201)}Phoenix
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.05,0:08:12.55,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\blur2\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\c&H241C41&\b1\move(40,69,-208,69)}Blue Dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.05,0:08:12.55,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\blur2\3c&HFFFFFF&\shad0\c&H241C41&\b1\move(819,134,571,134)}Golden Tiger
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.25,0:08:14.93,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,Our 44th athletic festival will now begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.55,0:08:15.30,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fs18\frz5\shad0\c&H4053D1&\3c&HFAFFFF&\move(241,37,267,37)}Entrance
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.61,0:08:18.22,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,{\an8}Neko, your hair looks so nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.23,0:08:19.62,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,The day is finally upon us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.27,0:08:20.29,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.00,0:08:22.97,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,It's time to show off the results\Nof our intensive practice!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.29,0:08:21.65,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,{\an8}I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.43,0:08:24.98,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Izumi! Baton!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.96,0:08:28.18,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Except...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.23,0:08:31.82,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,1)\pos(406,62)\fs36\b1\fnComic Sans MS\c&HF88D5C&\3c&H0F1310&\4c&HFBF9F9&\shad2}Hmm
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.87,0:08:30.02,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.02,0:08:31.81,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,She has no drive at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.58,0:08:35.57,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Hachimitsu-san is actually frowning.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.94,0:08:39.46,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I have to cheer her up somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.81,0:08:43.02,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Izumi, we need to head over \Nto the mock cavalry battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.02,0:08:45.05,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Huh? Er, hang on...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.34,0:08:46.53,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,{\an8}C'mon, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.91,0:08:47.21,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Hachimitsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.98,0:08:49.97,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Want to go cheer them on with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.80,0:08:51.76,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.44,0:08:54.94,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Participants in the mock cavalry battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.94,0:08:57.78,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}please assemble at area 3 inside the track.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.45,0:08:59.71,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Oh, Izumi's a horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.93,0:09:03.02,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Isn't being a horse gonna kill him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.02,0:09:05.47,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Can he even lift anyone up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.76,0:09:07.25,Main,Inu/Izu/BoyE,0,0,0,,Ready, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.57,0:09:10.49,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Wow, he's stronger than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.49,0:09:14.22,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Okay, don't break formation. \NRight foot first!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.74,0:09:23.17,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,"He's so cool. I love him."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.17,0:09:25.50,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,D-Don't give me a voiceover!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.09,0:09:29.79,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Good try.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.29,0:09:35.79,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Man, I never would have thought \Nit'd turn out like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.50,0:09:39.51,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(980,1)\fnComic Sans MS\fs30\an8\c&H554F52&\3c&HF2EDE6&\shad0}They lost
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.79,0:09:37.84,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Thanks, Inuzuka-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.84,0:09:39.50,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.14,0:09:44.20,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}The next event is the girls' ball toss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.93,0:09:46.32,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Aren't you in that, Hachimitsu-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.56,0:09:49.82,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}Participants, please assemble \Nat area 5 inside the track.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.30,0:09:50.69,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I guess I could just blow it off...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.69,0:09:52.37,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Hachimitsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.25,0:09:54.77,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.71,0:10:05.18,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Think she'll be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.18,0:10:07.53,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,The net's so high up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.54,0:10:11.54,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\frz-14\pos(349,242)\shad0\bord0\c&HA1D8F6&}Athletic Festival
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.89,0:10:10.90,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,The girls' ball toss will now begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.54,0:10:15.08,Main,Crowd,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.01,0:10:18.67,Main,Crowd,0,0,0,,You got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.67,0:10:20.01,Main,Student4 E10,0,0,0,,Nothing's going in!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.01,0:10:20.93,Main,Student5 E10,0,0,0,,It's too high up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.93,0:10:22.21,Main,Student6 E10,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.89,0:10:27.79,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's not going in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.79,0:10:30.93,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,The net's too high for girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.43,0:10:35.49,Main,Four,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.49,0:10:36.70,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,W-Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.43,0:10:39.94,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,B-But she's slow to pick up more balls!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.94,0:10:46.86,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,But they're all going in!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.86,0:10:47.92,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.92,0:10:49.81,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.90,0:10:54.98,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,First place in the girls' \Nball toss goes to Class 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.64,0:10:56.75,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,In second place...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.64,0:11:01.15,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Whew, that was a good laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.15,0:11:03.06,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,You burned out toward the end, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.06,0:11:05.73,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,If you had any stamina, \Nyou would've won.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.05,0:11:07.55,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.02,0:11:09.17,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Hachimitsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.66,0:11:11.92,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You did great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.91,0:11:15.53,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,You looked really cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.99,0:11:18.87,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Hachimitsu, you were seriously amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.87,0:11:21.18,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,You really are a riot, Hachimitsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.63,0:11:22.94,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Cut it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.97,0:11:25.06,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,That smug grin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.06,0:11:26.22,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,She looks so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.49,0:11:32.00,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fs18\frz5\shad0\c&H4053D1&\3c&HFAFFFF&\move(241,37,290,37)}Entrance
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.85,0:11:33.44,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,My hair's a mess, and I'm \Ncovered in sand. This sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.48,0:11:35.49,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.54,0:11:38.51,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.33,0:11:42.33,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,This athletic festival is more fun than most.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.20,0:11:45.58,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,All right, let's keep this up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.58,0:11:47.56,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,And kick butt in the relay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:48.83,Main,Izu/Shiki,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.60,0:11:53.02,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,1)\fnArial\fs20\b1\shad0\c&HFBFEFD&\blur4\3c&H404142&\pos(316.666,273.333)}That Afternoon
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.01,0:11:56.34,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,Participants in the boys and girls \Nmixed relay, please assemble.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.02,0:11:55.77,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fs30\fax.1\frz-13\shad0\c&H4053D1&\an8\3c&HFAFFFF&)\pos(375,63)}Entrance
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.34,0:11:58.65,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Should we say a prayer \Nfor Izumi's shoelaces?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.86,0:12:02.13,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,{\an8}I repeat: participants in the \Nboys and girls mixed relay...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.65,0:12:02.22,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Even if we do, some other stroke \Nof bad luck will find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.22,0:12:03.28,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Rude!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.28,0:12:08.67,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}He won't fall! They'll stay tied! It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.28,0:12:08.67,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,{\an8}Laces, stay tied! Shoes, stay on! Don't fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.75,0:12:07.03,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,H-Hey, come on! Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.93,0:12:08.66,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,They're not the least bit nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.04,0:12:11.00,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Let's do our best, Hachimitsu-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.00,0:12:11.91,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.13,0:12:15.44,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Let's win.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.45,0:12:21.63,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Hey, why aren't you guys saying anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.63,0:12:24.37,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Well said, Hachimitsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.92,0:12:26.73,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,She sure is motivated.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.99,0:12:27.85,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}Aw, Hachimitchoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.06,0:12:30.72,Main,Student7 E10,0,0,0,,First runners, third runners, \Nand anchors, please take your places!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.23,0:12:33.05,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Okay, ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.05,0:12:33.90,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.00,0:12:36.21,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Let's win this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.38,0:12:39.28,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,What was that all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.28,0:12:40.60,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Hachimitsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.00,0:12:42.87,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,We should get moving, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.93,0:12:45.85,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.12,0:12:48.68,Main,Crowd,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.78,0:12:54.63,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Normally, I don't get \Nnervous about anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.63,0:12:55.92,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,But I might puke.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.87,0:12:58.13,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(820,1)\an1\b1\fnComic Sans MS\pos(43,115)\c&H65F7F8&\3c&H334D9C&\shad0}Lub-dub  Lub-dub  Lub-dub  Lub-dub  Lub-dub  Lub-dub  Lub-dub
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.92,0:12:57.63,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Something's already dripping out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.70,0:13:00.24,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.45,0:13:06.64,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Yours is ice cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.64,0:13:08.50,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Because I'm nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.50,0:13:09.65,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,You?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.65,0:13:10.88,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.88,0:13:13.14,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,You don't look it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.68,0:13:17.47,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,That's because it doesn't matter who wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.47,0:13:19.16,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,What matters is that we have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.41,0:13:25.65,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Oh, please. You know you have \Nno intention of losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.46,0:13:28.73,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.97,0:13:31.15,Italics,Hachimitchoo,0,0,0,,Yikes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.46,0:13:33.68,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Your face is scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.68,0:13:34.53,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.88,0:13:36.06,Main,Student8 E10,0,0,0,,Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.06,0:13:37.04,Main,Student9 E10,0,0,0,,Fight hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.26,0:13:40.46,Main,Student10 E10,0,0,0,,Class 4!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.46,0:13:41.91,Main,Student11 E10,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.22,0:13:45.04,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,That's so cool. Everyone's really hyped up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.04,0:13:46.67,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Nekozaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.17,0:13:48.93,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Go get 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.29,0:13:51.03,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.63,0:13:53.94,Italics,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Will it all work out like we planned?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.37,0:13:56.02,Main,Guy,0,0,0,,Take your marks!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.79,0:13:59.55,Italics,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,I'm serious about this. Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.72,0:13:58.82,Main,Guy,0,0,0,,Set!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.93,0:14:02.32,Italics,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,I really want to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.15,0:14:11.17,Main,StudentA,0,0,0,,First and second are neck and neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.17,0:14:12.92,Main,StudentB,0,0,0,,Come on, Class 1!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.72,0:14:19.90,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Hachimitsu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.28,0:14:22.34,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.72,0:14:23.66,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,We're all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.47,0:14:25.76,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm{\i0} here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.34,0:14:31.81,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Sorry! I couldn't break away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.81,0:14:33.80,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,All yours, Hachimitsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.76,0:14:38.72,Main,Student10 E10,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.52,0:14:38.72,Main,Students8/9,0,0,0,,Keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.72,0:14:39.77,Main,Student12 E10,0,0,0,,Class 4!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.34,0:14:43.53,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Oh, crap...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.89,0:14:46.29,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,My mind is totally blank...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.61,0:14:48.74,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,H-Her face is melting!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.74,0:14:51.29,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Man... Is she worn out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.14,0:14:55.55,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Gah, passed already?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.55,0:14:57.28,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Her stride's so long...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.78,0:15:01.49,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,And I'm moving my legs faster \Nthan I ever have before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.49,0:15:04.65,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I seriously don't know \Nwhat's happening anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.01,0:15:08.71,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Um... Right, left...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.71,0:15:10.59,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Right, le—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.12,0:15:15.18,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.18,0:15:18.47,Main,Student13 E10,0,0,0,,That had to hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.22,0:15:20.09,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,H-Hachimitsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.47,0:15:19.79,Main,Student14 E10,0,0,0,,She went down face first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.79,0:15:20.93,Main,Student15 E10,0,0,0,,Is she okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.30,0:15:25.42,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Izumi's shoelace curse \Nhit Hachimitsu instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.42,0:15:26.95,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Can that happen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.17,0:15:29.50,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Uh... The baton...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.50,0:15:31.60,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Oh, I still have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.60,0:15:32.88,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.45,0:15:36.21,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Um, so now...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.21,0:15:37.22,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Hachimitsu-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.81,0:15:39.33,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Just a little farther!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.90,0:15:57.71,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,It isn't like me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.22,0:15:59.85,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,to talk about winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.65,0:16:03.07,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,They all looked shocked, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.21,0:16:05.98,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,But I can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.69,0:16:07.99,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,That's where I ended up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.39,0:16:12.86,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,After all that practice, \Nif we manage to win...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.47,0:16:17.80,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,How much will all of you smile?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.62,0:16:21.76,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Izumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.64,0:16:23.73,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,It's all yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.72,0:16:25.72,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.71,0:16:29.17,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,Class 4 has handed off the baton!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.17,0:16:30.50,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,Keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.91,0:16:33.37,Main,Student7 E10,0,0,0,,Fourth leg runners, get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.37,0:16:35.51,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Hachimitchoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.92,0:16:38.90,Main,Student8 E10,0,0,0,,There's a pretty big gap \Nbetween them and Class 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.90,0:16:40.46,Main,Student9 E10,0,0,0,,It's gonna be tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.46,0:16:42.52,Main,Student16 E10,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like they'll catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.97,0:16:44.71,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Hey, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.71,0:16:46.85,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I hurt so bad...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.85,0:16:49.61,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,And I'm even more exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.61,0:16:51.11,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Whoa, stop! Don't melt!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.66,0:16:54.35,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,But the hand-off went perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.38,0:16:59.25,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,In first place is Class 1! \NThey're moving fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.58,0:17:01.86,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,And in sixth place is Class 4!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.17,0:17:03.47,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.10,0:17:10.63,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,We fell into last place, \Nbut not by that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.82,0:17:13.60,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I can at least catch up to this guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.50,0:17:18.01,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,That's it, Izumi! Please keep this up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.20,0:17:23.52,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.15,0:17:26.51,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,This always happens, doesn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.09,0:17:28.52,Flashback,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,It's all yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.29,0:17:33.83,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,No! We can't lose because of my bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.83,0:17:37.48,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Not this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:39.29,Main,Nekozaki,0,0,0,,He stayed on his feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.05,0:17:45.50,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Damn, he's amazing! \NHe kicked off both shoes at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.50,0:17:49.42,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I get it. His bad luck actually saved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.64,0:17:51.75,Main,Students8/9/16,0,0,0,,Is that even possible?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.41,0:17:56.18,Main,Student12,0,0,0,,You can do it, Izumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.18,0:17:58.17,Main,Student10,0,0,0,,Go, Class 4!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.17,0:18:00.43,Main,Student17 E10,0,0,0,,Man, he's a riot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.68,0:18:03.67,Main,Student18 E10,0,0,0,,Anchors, stand by!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.67,0:18:04.67,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.11,0:18:05.82,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.39,0:18:07.63,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.63,0:18:10.82,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,You look scary with that \Nserious face. Could you stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.08,0:18:12.49,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.49,0:18:16.79,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Also, I'm about to run.\N Aren't you gonna cheer me on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.08,0:18:20.78,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,O-Oh... G-Go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.50,0:18:22.30,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.23,0:18:26.44,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,It's no use. I can't pass him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.44,0:18:28.53,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,At least I didn't let the gap widen, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.81,0:18:30.88,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Sorry, Shikimori-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.41,0:18:38.59,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,I wonder why it is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.28,0:18:44.58,Italics,Izumi,0,0,0,,Even in a tight spot like this, \NI somehow believe you'll make it happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.24,0:18:52.83,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Win, Shikimori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.79,0:19:09.34,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I can't see...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.34,0:19:11.57,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Why is everyone so excited?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.87,0:19:14.08,Main,Student Boy,0,0,0,,Who is she?! She's so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.09,0:19:22.87,Main,3-1 Boy3,0,0,0,,She's already up to second place!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.87,0:19:24.10,Main,3-1 Boy1,0,0,0,,How awesome is she?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.38,0:19:27.56,Main,3-1 Boy2,0,0,0,,I don't think she's gonna catch \Nup to first place, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.10,0:19:31.82,Italics,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Damn, she kicked up the pace again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.82,0:19:33.84,Italics,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Shikimori really is fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.10,0:19:39.88,Italics,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,If she was chasing me, \NI wonder if I could get away...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.56,0:19:43.37,Italics,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,She's staring right at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.37,0:19:46.87,Italics,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,And those eyes! If I don't win,\N she's gonna kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.87,0:19:47.83,Main,First Place Runner,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.66,0:19:52.26,Italics,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.81,0:19:55.25,Italics,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Nekozaki made it to first \Nplace right off the bat,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.72,0:19:59.26,Italics,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,and Hachimitsu made the hand-off \Njust like she practiced.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.93,0:20:01.93,Italics,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Izumi didn't even fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.43,0:20:04.75,Italics,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,And Shikimori made up the ground we'd lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.96,0:20:07.01,Italics,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,All that's left...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.78,0:20:09.26,Flashback_Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Let's win.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.88,0:20:12.52,Italics,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,...is for me to keep my promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.74,0:20:18.96,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,Their anchor has the baton now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.96,0:20:21.35,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,Class 4 is making a huge comeback!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.72,0:20:27.97,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.13,0:20:30.46,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.53,0:20:37.78,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,In first place...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.78,0:20:39.05,Italics,Announcer,0,0,0,,Class 4!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.28,0:20:42.54,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.50,0:20:45.05,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Inuzuka-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.05,0:20:45.94,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,Izumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.82,0:20:55.11,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,We actually won.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.11,0:20:56.31,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Shikimori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.95,0:21:03.11,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,Everyone was watching you when \Nyou passed the next runner!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.11,0:21:06.68,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,That was so amazing! We actually won!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.68,0:21:08.55,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,What do I do?! I think I'm gonna cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.55,0:21:10.79,Main,Shikimori,0,0,0,,Uh... Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.79,0:21:13.22,Main,Inuzuka,0,0,0,,He's way too frank...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.08,0:21:14.01,Main,Text,0,0,0,,{\fad(190,1)\b1\fnComic Sans MS\c&HBA9CEE&\3c&H895DD8&\shad0\4c&H895DD8&\pos(174,93)}Got Praised to High Heaven
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.61,0:21:14.05,Main,Izumi,0,0,0,,That was really wild, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.18,0:21:16.79,Main,Student7 E10,0,0,0,,First place winners,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.29,0:21:19.22,Main,Student7 E10,0,0,0,,take this and line up, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.22,0:21:20.55,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.84,0:21:27.06,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,We really managed to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.12,0:21:31.43,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.80,0:21:36.24,Main,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,That was fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.26,0:21:44.86,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,I'm glad I met you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.64,0:21:47.62,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,You're so cute, and so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.11,0:21:51.78,Italics,Hachimitsu,0,0,0,,You're friends I can be proud of.
